        "finalUrl": "https://www.pentagram.com/",
        "contentType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
        "pageTitle": "Pentagram — The world’s largest independent design consultancy",
        "pageDescription": "Pentagram is the world’s largest independent design consultancy. The firm is owned and run by 24 partners, each of whom are leaders in their individual fields.",
        "evidenceText": "Pentagram — The world’s largest independent design consultancy Pentagram Search Arts & Culture Civic & Public Climate & Sustainability Consumer Brands Education Entertainment Fashion & Beauty Finance Food & Drink Health Hospitality & Travel Manufacturing & Industrials Non-profits Professional Services Publishing Real Estate Technology Transport Books Brand Identity Brand Strategy Campaigns Data Driven Experiences Digital Experiences Exhibitions Industrial/Product Design Motion Graphics & Film Naming Packaging Publications Signage & Environmental Graphics Typefaces Verbal Identity The Obama Presidential Center The typographic installation on the façade of the new museum in Chicago features an excerpt from President Obama’s 2015 ‘You Are America’ speech. Pfizer Strategic identity, brand architecture, and design system for Pfizer’s next chapter. Design Doha Biennial A dynamic bilingual identity for Design Doha Biennial, connecting languages, disciplines and voices across the Arab region. ICD Beauty Brand identity and packaging for the Seoul-based beauty brand merging biotechnology with daily rituals. Hiut Visual identity and art direction for a company making beautifully crafted premium denim from its family-run factory in Aberteifi, Wales. ‘A Data Love Letter to the Subway’ A data-driven animation for Fulton Center commissioned by MTA Arts & Design for its 40th anniversary. Guggenheim Visual identity for the constellation of global art museums. Rugiet Brand identity and custom typeface for a fast-growing leader in men’s health. Folger Shakespeare Library Visual identity and signage for the world’s largest Shakespeare collection, located in Washington, DC. Natural History Museum Moving the Museum from catalogue to catalyst. Behold Wildlife Camera Industrial design of a species-detecting AI-powered camera that makes following wildlife in your garden simple, engaging and fun. MoN Takanawa: The Museum of Narratives Brand identity, naming and verbal identity for a radical new cultural destination in Tokyo. We design everything for everyone We design  Everything Books Brand Identity Brand Strategy Campaigns Data Driven Experiences Digital Experiences Exhibitions Industrial/Product Design Motion Graphics & Film Naming Packaging Publications Signage & Environmental Graphics Typefaces Verbal Identity  for  Everyone Arts & Culture Civic & Public Climate & Sustainability Consumer Brands Education Entertainment Fashion & Beauty Finance Food & Drink Health Hospitality & Travel Manufacturing & Industrials Non-profits Professional Services Publishing Real Estate Technology Transport Discipline Books Brand Identity Brand Strategy Campaigns Data Driven Experiences Digital Experiences Exhibitions Industrial/Product Design Motion Graphics & Film Naming Packaging Publications Signage & Environmental Graphics Typefaces Verbal Identity Sector Arts & Culture Civic & Public Climate & Sustainability Consumer Brands Education Entertainment Fashion & Beauty Finance Food & Drink Health Hospitality & Travel Manufacturing & Industrials Non-profits Professional Services Publishing Real Estate Technology Transport We design  Everything  for  Everyone The Secret Life of Things Industrial design, the art of helping objects tell their stories, has been a key part of Pentagram from the start. The legendary Sir Kenneth Grange, designer of the Anglepoise lamp and British Rail’s InterCity 125 train, was one of the firm’s five founders. That commitment has been maintained over the last half century by designers such as Daniel Weil and Robert Brunner, and continues to flourish through partners Jon Marshall and Piotr Woronkowicz. While the output today is just as likely to be computing hardware and electric vehicles as cookware and cosmetic packaging, the challenge of finding magic and meaning in the meeting of form and function remains the same. Caligra c100 Developer Terminal Industrial design of computer hardware for professional environments. MINI x DEUS Collaboration with Deus Ex Machina and MINI on comprehensive designs for two one-off John Cooper Works cars. Loka Chai Maker Industrial design of an innovative new device for making chai easily at home. Dr. Jart+ Containers and product design for the global skincare brand that fuses science and art. Peter F. Collier Award for Ethics in Journalism Design and production development for the New York University Collier Awards. Behold Wildlife Camera Industrial design of a species-detecting AI-powered camera that makes following wildlife in your garden simple, engaging and fun. Gush Brand identity framework for a company that creates innovative materials for the built environment that support well-being. Yoto Player 3rd Generation Industrial design for an audio content and device brand for families. See latest projects Firaxis Games A new identity, bespoke typography and motion for Firaxis Games Entertainment London Life A typographic love letter to the capital shown on London’s most iconic big screen. Arts & Culture St. Louis Symphony Orchestra Brand strategy and visual identity for one of the nation's most enduring orchestras. Arts & Culture Thames Tideway’s Bronze Drain Covers A special set of bronze drain covers celebrating the engineering bringing cleaner water to the city. Arts & Culture ‘All Our Blood’ A new large-scale installation presented by Harry Pearce at the inaugural Kyoto YouMe Triennale. Arts & Culture BFI London Film Festival Brand identity and campaign for the 2026 Festival. Entertainment Arts & Culture MTA Arts & Design 40th A commemorative identity for the 40th anniversary of MTA Arts & Design. Civic & Public Storefront Gala 2026 The identity for Storefront for Art and Architecture's annual benefit borrows its alphabet from the Grand Central Oyster Bar. Arts & Culture Retrospective: Shakespeare in the Park In 1954, impresario Joe Papp began a summer tradition of staging free outdoor performances of Shakespeare, inaugurating the Public Theater’s beloved Shakespeare in the Park festival. Pentagram partner Paula Scher, whose relationship with the Public spans four decades, has designed a new identity for the series for thirty consecutive summers. Each campaign is customized to the season’s theme, creating a highly visible graphic vocabulary for outdoor advertising, social media, and on-site signage. (28) 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2019 2018 2017 2016 2015 2014 2013 2012 2011 2010 2009 2008 2007 2006 2005 2003 2001 2000 1999 1998 1997 1996 1995 Show more Retrospective: Shakespeare in the Park In 1954, impresario Joe Papp began a summer tradition of staging free outdoor performances of Shakespeare, inaugurating the Public Theater’s beloved Shakespeare in the Park festival. Pentagram partner Paula Scher, whose relationship with the Public spans four decades, has designed a new identity for the series for thirty consecutive summers. Each campaign is customized to the season’s theme, creating a highly visible graphic vocabulary for outdoor advertising, social media, and on-site signage. 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2019 2018 2017 2016 2015 2014 2013 2012 2011 2010 2009 2008 2007 2006 2005 2003 2001 2000 1999 1998 1997 1996 1995 Because of my editorial background I believe that everything we do is about storytelling. Whether it’s a design or a package, it needs to tell you a story. It needs to tell you something. DJ Stout 8 latest Brand Identity projects Design Doha Biennial A dynamic bilingual identity for Design Doha Biennial, connecting languages, disciplines and voices across the Arab region. Arts & Culture <source media=\"screen and (min-width: 1040px)\" data-srcset=\"https://pentagram-production.imgix.net/237577c3-82f5-4a07-87f1-bc3c5f3fb45a/MW_EsDevlin_01Cover.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&fit=min&fm=jpg&q=80&rect=307%2C0%2C3242%2C2161&w=1304&h=869&s=d9efa146c075f0550bf2003b6877148b, https://pentagram-production.imgix.net/237577c3-82f5-4a07-8",
