        "evidenceText": "British Cartographic Society | geospatial visualisation community top of page A Community of Geospatial Professionals and Map Enthusiasts The British Cartographic Society, founded in 1963, embraces everyone involved in geospatial data and maps with a focus on data visualisation and the power of great cartography.​ ​  Members come from national mapping agencies, local and central government, GIS specialisms, publishers, freelance cartographers, researchers and those who just love maps.   Next Teatime Talk   \"Mapping the Unconnected World: How Satellite IoT Is Creating New Global Data Layers\"   Speaker: Eric Hewitson, Lacuna Space Date: Thursday 19th November Time: LUNCHTIME 12:45 - 13:30 More details At the heart of the Geospatial world in the UK Opportunities for networking, education, information and support Engage and learn from leading industry experts Access our GeoViz Resource Centre Contribute to our active Social Media Liaise with partners across the geospatial community in the UK and beyond JOIN BCS ​ ​ <iframe data-hook=\"video-iframe-placeholder\" class=\"gallery-item-content video-iframe-placeholder\" title=\"pro-gallery-video\" style=\"width:400px;height:500px;margin-top:0;margin-left:0\" allow=\"fullscreen\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMPtJO0Q30iYYkiVwNbq6M0n6FV7Aa8Kss1h8nJtooAE8_3Jw9AE6ALdpssJCMetrLCPZjDvhnRE6hMbMSTr4ViUE4wnix-L-n166g.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=j-accjyRD28Q7kNvwEfkT5U&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTg0NDM0MDM2OTQxOTI2NzcsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjozOSwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTAwOTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjg3LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=68ff524cbc11e8e&_nc_",
