 ages Explore Methodologies Backlight Podcast: Backlight 30.10.2026 Journalism Q&A episode; pitching stories, career advice, fellowships, funding & more You sent the questions. We answer them. Podcast: Backlight 25.09.2026 Do you need to go to journalism school? Part 2 (Teacher Edition) Last month we asked two early career journalists how they got in the field. This month we take the conversation to the other side of the classroom. Podcast: Backlight 28.08.2026 Do you need to go to journalism school? Does Journalism school still matter? Podcast: Backlight 21.07.2026 Reclaiming the migration narrative When migration is talked about in the language of fear and crisis, how do journalists tell the true human story? Podcast: Backlight 15.06.2026 Lessons from Local News From the UK to India and the Brazilian Amazon, we spoke with journalists who are making it work. Podcast: Backlight 06.05.2026 How can the media win back our trust? Trust in traditional media is in crisis. This is what media leaders are doing about it. Explore Backlight Work with us Lighthouse offers the opportunity to work on a fascinating range of investigations in partnership with some of the biggest media brands in Europe. We are committed to a diverse and inclusive working environment and encourage applications from under-represented groups. Job Openings",
