      "id": "08d84184eea4b92c09d996202520e177744c0819b4fe128679886d0bc76a69ae",
      "title": "Briefing: The AI image gotcha game",
      "url": "https://www.404media.co/voting-in-2026-is-getting-an-ai-slop-i-voted-sticker",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "providers": [
