      "id": "26349cbb9e2aecbe8402f767f49a8a4c625fceebd9bfc09e85cc71a06c03e2c8",
      "title": "The day after the night that changed the country",
      "url": "https://www.vox.com/politics/509258/republicans-midterm-disaster-blame-theories-iran-war-corruption",
