        "pageDescription": "30 likes, 1 comments - mediawise on October 26, 2026: &quot;&#x1f30e; What&#x2019;s the biggest media literacy tip we&#x2019;ve learned in 2026?\n\nIn honor of Global Media Literacy Week, media literacy organizations from across the world were convened by MediaWise and developed a 2026 Tip of the Year:\n\n&#x1f4a1; Everyone needs the &#x201c;screen intelligence&#x201d; to pause before believing or sharing something online. But in a world full of AI-generated content, that now has to include understanding how AI works and how it might impact what you&#x2019;re seeing.\n\nThis tip was based on submissions from Global Media Literacy Network members, selected through member voting and revised through collaboration between members. Representatives from organizations on six continents contributed.\n\n#M",
