        "evidenceText": "Olivia Reingold on X: \"Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really… / X Post Log in Sign up Post Log in Sign up Olivia Reingold on X: \"Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really wearing those items. The observation holds. Here’s the photo I took:\" Conversation Olivia Reingold @Olivia_Reingold Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really wearing those items. The observation holds. Here’s the photo I took: 5:26 PM · Nov 5, 2026 · 1.6M Views 786 311 567 185 Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Relevant people Olivia Reingold @ Olivia_Reingold Follow staff writer @thefp tbt: @politico , @report4america , @columbiajourn What’s happening Show more Olivia Reingold @Olivia_Reingold Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really wearing those items. The observation holds. Here’s the photo I took: 5:26 PM · Nov 5, 2026 · 1.6M Views 786 311 567 185 Olivia Reingold @Olivia_Reingold Nov 5 Here’s another: 96 8 117 221K Moha