hecking, commentary and resources about the news media from our nonprofit newsrooms. Our targeted, engaged audience includes 250K+ journalists and media leaders, communications and technology professionals, journalism educators, students, fact-checkers and citizens interested in the news media. Sponsor – $$ Sponsored posts available for all Poynter and PolitiFact newsletters, except the Poynter Pro Weekly. One-week minimum for dailies; one-month minimum for weeklies. Subject to availability Includes a headline eight words or less, image of 1020px wide (.jpg or .png), description of 70 words or less, call to action five words or less and hyperlink,​ plus your ​clickable logo​ at the bottom of the newsletter. Logo should be horizontal, high-resolution .png file Reserve now ➡️ Partner – $$$ Available for The Poynter Report and Open Tabs 6-month minimum investment, highest visibility Please inquire Learn more about our newsletters and sponsorship options ➡️ . PolitiFact.com advertising options Poynter is the home of the Pulitzer Prize-winning PolitiFact website and its newsletters (see above). The site had 27 million pageviews in 2023. Website ads are $6 CPM, available sizes 300×250, 320×50 and 300×600. Native advertising opportunities are also available. Poynter.org advertising options Analytics and demographics (November 2024 through October 2025) Users: 3.6 million over 12 months, with a monthly average of 463,000 Location: U.S. 72%, Canada 4%, UK 4%. Other countries 3% or less Gender: 52% male, 48% female Age: Largest audience segment is 18-24 Pageviews: 5.6 million, with a monthly average of 460,000 Interests: News & politics/avid news readers ROS display ads Advertising rates start at $5 per 1,000 impressions (CPM). ​Suggested buy: $1,000 for 200,000 impressions per month. Ad sizes: Please provide 970×250 (a top performer), 320×50, 728×90, 300×250 (72 dpi). Please provide all sizes​ to reach both desktop and mobile. Ads must be JPGs, not PDFs. Sponsored content ​Publish your article targeted to Poynter’s audience on ​poynter.org​. Includes lead image, author profile, article with links and position on home page for 24 hours, findable by search and direct link for 12 months. Poynter’s marketing staff will consult with you to edit a story you write ( here’s an example ). Length: 500-800 words. The article will be labeled as sponsored content in a subhead, in keeping with our ethics and transparency policies. We will promote it with one post from Poynter’s Facebook account and two posts from Poynter’s X account. $1,850 Media Job Board The Media Job Board is Poynter’s employment website in partnership with Editor & Publisher and America’s Newspapers. To post job openings, click here. Sponsor Poynter teaching By sponsoring a Poynter workshop or online course, your brand and message will reach an engaged, targeted audience. Poynter retains control over all teaching, per our ethics policy. Pricing varies based on benefits received — ask for details. For detailed information, including rates and availability, or to have a custom media plan developed, please email advertising@poynter.org",
