g but brilliant' post-apocalyptic novel The End of Everything wins Booker Prize Prince William wants more protection from harassment for service women News Daily: Our flagship daily newsletter delivered to your inbox first thing, with all the latest headlines Elsewhere on the BBC A familiar fixture in film that reflects British life Comedian Bob Mortimer chooses his Desert Island Discs Dashcam Justice: Small cameras, big consequences The first execution by lethal injection in the US Most read 1 David Walliams accused of sexual misconduct after losing injunction bid 2 US Army soldier suspected of spying for Russia arrested in UK 3 Meghan's father Thomas Markle detained for allegedly cutting off ankle monitor, officials say 4 Train attack driver's '10 seconds' to change line 5 Seven in hospital after car 'mounts pavement' in Glasgow 6 French wartime resistance heroine Solange Alexandre dies aged 104 7 Why does Australia want Brits to swap Sydney for the outback? 8 Inside devastated front-line city that Russia wants Ukraine to give up 9 More than 12 US military aircraft leave second UK base 10 Stevie Wonder leaves cafe staff £1,000 tip",
