      "title": "Misread Mandate",
      "url": "https://www.cjr.org/the_media_today/an-ice-cube-that-is-melting-nick-bilton-bari-weiss-why-revolutionize-60-minutes-cbs-news-tigers-firing-trump-ellison.php",
