      "id": "ca423f402965c5bbc5f73ae8820bb9042361301ed2597dd7941d7a009d719a76",
      "title": "Misread Mandate",
      "url": "https://www.newyorker.com/news/fault-lines/the-intertwined-legacies-of-rupert-murdoch-and-donald-trump",
      "category": "uncategorized",
