      "id": "cdaa3e8a4c4cb7c52229a18ceb5a284076b116149db3ada0447d98e4b44e6de8",
      "title": "Misread Mandate",
      "url": "https://www.cjr.org/business_of_news/questions-abc-news-should-answer-16-million-trump-settlement.php",
      "category": "uncategorized",
