        "pageDescription": "Take your editing from transactional to transformational in this five-week course designed for new editors. Join program lead Tom Huang and industry veterans Maria Carrillo, Kathleen McGrory and Tony Elkins for a training that equips you to coach inexperienced reporters, build strong editor-journalist relationships across work environments, and guide your reporters to develop ambitious and quick enterprise off their beats. You&#039;ll strengthen your line editing, learn to provide clear direction to scattered writers and gain the confidence to coach rather than just correct.",
