        "pageTitle": "Watch the first episode of &quot;Show &amp; Tell&quot; from Indicator",
        "pageDescription": "We talk about investigating Meta scam ads with Jeff Horwitz from Reuters",
        "evidenceText": "Watch the first episode of \"Show & Tell\" from Indicator This website uses cookies Read our Privacy policy and Terms of use for more information . Accept Customize Decline Watch the first episode of \"Show & Tell\" from Indicator We talk about investigating Meta scam ads with Jeff Horwitz from Reuters Craig Silverman & Alexios Mantzarlis Feb 3, 2026 We’re excited to announce the first episode of our new podcast, Show & Tell from Indicator . It takes you inside digital investigations as leading journalists, OSINT investigators, threat analysts, and researchers walk through a real story, report, or case they worked on. Each episode features a recognized figure in the OSINT, digital investigations, or trust & safety community. Show & Tell is hosted by us, Alexios Mantzarlis and Craig Silverman, and our first guest is Jeff Horwitz. Jeff is an investigative reporter for Reuters who has done some of the most impressive investigations into Meta’s products and systems. Before joining Reuters, Jeff covered Meta for The Wall Street Journal where he broke lots of stories, including about the prevalence of child exploitation on its products and the big Facebook Files investigation that used a trove of internal documents to reveal Instagram's negative impact on teen mental health, the facilitation of human trafficking, the amplification of political violence, and more. He continued his coverage of Meta at Reuters where he recently published a great series about how Meta has earned billions from online scam ads and at times thwarted efforts to rein them in. Meta is earning a fortune on a deluge of fraudulent ads, documents show Meta projected 10% of its 2024 revenue would come from ads for scams and banned goods. www.reuters.com/investigations/meta-is-earning-fortune-deluge-fraudulent-ads-documents-show-2025-11-06 That’s what we wanted to talk to him about. In particular, we wanted to hear about how he ran an experiment that saw him actually purchase and run scam ads on Meta . Meta’s “Trusted Experts” helped me run scam ads on Facebook and Instagram A Reuters reporter created ads promising unrealistic investment returns and easily placed them on Meta's social media platforms. www.reuters.com/investigations/metas-trusted-experts-helped-me-run-scam-ads-facebook-instagram-2025-12-15 We hope you enjoy and learn from the conversation. Catch every episode by subscribing to our YouTube channel . We’re also on Spotify and Apple Podcasts . Have a suggestion for who we should feature next? Email us . Keep Reading Indicator is your essential guide to understanding and investigating digital deception. Subscribe for free I consent to receive newsletters via email. Sign up Terms of service . ABOUT ARCHIVE UPGRADE window.__remixContext = {\"basename\":\"/\",\"future\":{\"v3_fetcherPersist\":false,\"v3_relativeSplatPath\":false,\"v3_throwAbortReason\":false,\"v3_routeConfig\":false,\"v3_singleFetch\":false,\"v3_lazyRouteDiscovery\":false,\"unstable_optimizeDeps\":false},\"isSpaMode\":false,\"state\":{\"loaderData\":{\"root\":{\"site\":{\"id\":\"307061ed-0223-42d6-b0bb-9db60103a5c8\",\"theme_rules\":{\"section\":{\"background_color\":[\"backgroundColor\"]},\"container\":{\"background_color\":[\"backgroundColor\"],\"border_color\":[\"borderColor\"],\"border_radius\":[\"borderRadius\"]},\"columns\":{\"background_color\":[\"backgroundColor\"]},\"doc\":{\"background_color\":[\"backgroundColor\"]},\"text\":{\"text_on_background_color\":[\"color\"],\"header_font\":[\"fontFamily\"]},\"signup\":{\"primary_color\":[\"borderColor\",\"buttonBackgroundColor\",\"inputBorderColor\",\"inputRadioCheckboxAccentColor\",\"gdprCheckboxColor\"],\"text_on_primary_color\":[\"buttonTextColor\",\"buttonIconColor\"],\"border_color\":[\"buttonBorderColor\"],\"background_color\":[\"inputBackgroundColor\"],\"text_on_background_color\":[\"inputTextColor\",\"gdprTextColor\"],\"border_radius\":[\"borderRadius\",\"inputBorderRadius\",\"buttonBorderRadius\"],\"body