        "pageDescription": "Solutions Journalism Network Email Forms",
        "evidenceText": "Solutions Journalism Network The Solutions Journalism Network is dedicated to transforming journalism so that everyone has the information they need to build stronger, healthier communities. Sign up for our newsletters for the best in solutions journalism tools, opportunities and stories. Fields marked with an asterisk (*) are required.  If you want to do solutions journalism...  Above the Fold - Join thousands of journalists around the world receiving our flagship newsletter filled with opportunities, news and resources from the world of solutions journalism  (weekly) Solutions Africa -  Receive in-depth updates by and for t he newsrooms, journalists, freelancers, policymakers and experts committed to covering responses to social problems on the continent  (monthly) If you want to get high-quality solutions reporting... The Response - Get three great, diverse solutions stories to help you discover what's working  (biweekly) Solutions Worth Sharing: Climate  - Two compelling climate solutions stories, complete with a quick blurb you can share in your own newsletter or Tweet with a click  (biweekly) Solutions Worth Sharing: Advancing Democracy   - Same as above, but with stories about strengthening democratic participation  (biweekly) Or get Custom Story Alerts tailored to your passions here. If you want to teach solutions journalism (or teach with it)... Making the Grade - Resources and lessons for teaching solutions journalism, or using it to teach a variety of subjects  (monthly) * indicates required Name: Email: Comment: Email Address* * First Name* * Last Name* * City State Alabama Alaska Arizona Arkansas California Colorado Connecticut Delaware Florida Georgia Hawaii Idaho Illinois Indiana Iowa Kansas Kentucky Louisiana Maine Maryland Massachusetts Michigan Minnesota Mississippi Missouri Montana Nebraska Nevada New Hampshire New Jersey New Mexico New York North Carolina North Dakota Ohio Oklahoma Oregon Pennsylvania Rhode Island South C