      "id": "82e4b5fe7e575b36a082447b3d7c8f66f5be7b409147c917f36d0108f9e93e94",
      "title": "Ohio Midterms Prove ‘Pink Slime’ News Is Bipartisan",
      "url": "https://www.latimes.com/california/story/2026-10-25/california-group-linked-to-news-site-promoting-controversial-ramaswamy-ad",
      "category": "uncategorized",
