      "id": "0b053d4932931e0f344b441bb0dfe6ffe2133085dcc95499cef92f6fd83df01b",
      "title": "It’s been a great year for investigative reporting. But there’s a catch.",
      "url": "https://www.poynter.org/ethics-trust/2026/journalist-creators-media-trust-social-media",
      "category": "uncategorized",
