      "id": "1af4db1ff1ef41d70faeeead4a56d97e9442d9b4ee7d778d8221bba52dc43e75",
      "title": "Longtime NBC Sports announcer Dan Hicks, dies suddenly. He was 64",
      "url": "https://www.nytimes.com/athletic/7776092/2026/11/12/nbc-sports-dan-hicks-death-career",
      "category": "uncategorized",
