        "evidenceText": "Channel Search - Discover Geo-tagged Videos - MW Geofind Loading... Update 2023.06.05 &mdash; Following a YouTube audit, the application name had to be changed and export feature removed. Idle Channel Search Check the uploads of channel(s) for geotagged videos. This page is essentially YouTube Metadata Bulk but with a map and all data filtered to only the geotagged ones. Recommended to instead export data from YMB and import here if you want the data for everything not geotagged too. Submit a comma separated list of multiple videos, playlists, or channels Submit Accepted formats https://www. youtube.com/channel/ channel_id https://www. youtube.com/user/ username https://www. youtube.com/@ channel_handle https://www. youtube.com/c/ custom_url https://www. youtube.com/ custom_url Also accepts direct ids: channel_id Export & Share Save this result as a zip file or load from a previous export. Drag and drop supported.   Export     Import Contains file(s) about.txt - Metadata about this result. videos.json - Array of all raw video data. channels.json - Array of all raw channel data. geotags.csv - Geotags in csv format. Share this search: Use absolute timeframe What happened to export? Geotags Alternate view of results that are in the map. Want to see, search, and filter more detailed data about these videos? Export this result and import into YouTube Metadata Bulk . mattwright324 | 2027 | home | github | youtube-geofind privacy | terms of use | contact",
